  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum模組。用心製作。支援 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>附魔等級上限指示器是一款客戶端模組，幫助玩家判斷物品上的附魔是否已達到最高等級。雖然經驗豐富的玩家已牢記各項附魔的等級上限，但新的冒險者並不清楚。當附魔達到最高潛力時，會在附魔等級旁顯示一個符號。預設使用金色星星，但你可以在設定中將其更改為你喜歡的任何符號。<br><br>適用於附魔台、鐵砧與物品欄的物品提示資訊。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Vanilla Experience 整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>maxLevelSymbol</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"⭐\"<br>用來表示附魔已達最高等級的符號。預設為星星。<br><br><span><strong>maxLevelSymbolColourIndex</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 6，最小值 0，最大值 15<br>最高等級符號使用的顏色索引值。可能的值為；0: 黑色, 1: 深藍色, 2: 深綠色, 3: 深青色, 4: 深紅色, 5: 深紫色, 6: 金色, 7: 灰色, 8: 深灰色, 9: 藍色, 10: 綠色, 11: 青色, 12: 紅色, 13: 淺紫色, 14: 黃色, 15: 白色<br><br></p>\n<p><br><span><strong>輕鬆查看你的工具上哪些附魔已滿等！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>星星標記已滿等的附魔：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span><strong>在附魔提示旁顯示符號：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>在鐵砧中同樣有效：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>不喜歡星星？使用自訂符號與顏色！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/max-enchantment-indicator/e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
